# Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
out/

# Visual Studio / Rider
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Local secrets — connection strings live here, never commit
appsettings.Development.json

# School purge archives. Written by SuperAdmin/Schools/Purge before a school is
# permanently deleted; each file is that school's ENTIRE data set — students,
# staff, fee payments, transfer certificates, logins. Never commit, and keep it
# out of wwwroot (it already is) so it is not web-servable either.
# Back these up separately: they are the only way to recover a purged school.
educore/App_Data/school-archives/

# Data Protection key ring. The XML files in here ARE the encryption keys that sign the
# auth cookie and protect any IDataProtector value — committing them would let anyone
# forge both. Each environment generates its own; production keeps them on a mounted volume.
educore/App_Data/keys/

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
